  "texts": {
    "preamble": "M/S Amg Enterprises And Another vs State Of U.P. And 2 Others on 13 September, 2019 Bench: Pankaj Mithal, Saral Srivastava High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Court No. - 29 Case :- Writ - C No. - 27379 of 2019 Petitioner :- M/S Amg Enterprises And Another Respondent :- State Of U.P. And 2 Others Counsel for Petitioner :- Abhijeet Singh",
    "facts": "The petitioners are challenging the order dated 31.01.2019 passed by the Adjudicating Authority/Additional District Magistrate (Admn.), Gautam Buddh Nagar in exercise of powers under Section 51 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 and the consequential recovery dated 25.07.2019. The aforesaid order is appellable under Section 70 of the Act before the Food Safety Appellate Tribunal and the order of the Tribunal thereof is further appellable to the High Court under Section 71(6)/76 of the Act.",
